@startuml
[*] --> PENDING : reservasi / hold 15 menit
PENDING --> PAID : settlement/capture trusted\namount cocok, hold valid
PENDING --> EXPIRED : deadline / expire
PENDING --> CANCELLED : deny / failure / cancel
PENDING --> PAYMENT_REVIEW : pembayaran terlambat
EXPIRED --> PAYMENT_REVIEW : late settlement
CANCELLED --> PAYMENT_REVIEW : late settlement
PAID --> REFUNDED : full refund / chargeback
PAID --> CANCELLED : void capture
PAID --> PAYMENT_REVIEW : partial refund / partial chargeback
PAYMENT_REVIEW --> REFUNDED : full refund / chargeback
note right of PAID
  Terbitkan tiket tepat sekali.
  Email lewat outbox terpisah.
  Replay pending tidak membalik PAID.
end note
@enduml
